# 021 · Enrollment codes

**Status:** `READY` · **Version:** [v0.1.0](../roadmap.md#v010) · **Part:** Rigs on RunPod

## What

Control mints a rig ID and a one-time enrollment code for a launched pod. At first contact, the rig exchanges the code for its token. Control accepts the key of a rig it launched, bound to that code.

## Why

The long-lived rig token must never appear in RunPod's settings or console.

## Done when

- [ ] A launched rig enrolls once with its code. A second use is refused.
- [ ] Tests cover expiry and reuse.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

